  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "587171c76a528b2b",
      "translationZh": "使用 Project Genie 和 Street View 模拟现实世界中的地点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "75d499c31cb9c63d",
      "translationZh": "我们正将使用权限扩展至全球的 Google AI Ultra 订阅用户，并推出一项由 Street View 提供支持的新功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5bd26886895ec63d",
      "translationZh": "Google DeepMind 产品经理组负责人",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5cfd62d8e998c456",
      "translationZh": "Maps 首席产品经理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "223ad72cf83a9105",
      "translationZh": "Google Labs 助理产品经理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
      "translationZh": "您的浏览器不支持音频元素。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9396d34c840bf012",
      "translationZh": "此内容由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 尚处于实验阶段",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f793f8de23c16d13",
      "translationZh": "Genie 是我们的通用世界模型，能够生成多样化的交互式环境。自推出以来，Genie 已成为一项基础性研究工具，使智能体能够在复杂的虚拟场景中学习和推理，甚至帮助 Waymo 模拟高度逼真的道路环境。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "61e3d233d5dc53bd",
      "translationZh": "现在，我们正向前迈出一大步，将 Genie 的生成能力与 Google Street View 的真实世界影像相连接，让我们的模型能够以现实为基础。Genie 能力的这一扩展可以提供一个虚拟环境，让 AI 智能体或机器人在其中探索真实世界的复杂情境并与之交互。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84574d299a3897d3",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们在实验性原型 Project Genie 中推出这项全新的 Street View 现实锚定能力。通过此次升级，你将能够利用真实世界影像探索自己喜爱的地点，或以富有创意的方式重新构想这些地方。我们也将向全球更多用户开放 Project Genie。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c45d852dd7159ee7",
      "translationZh": "选择“Ocean World”风格，即可在以真实世界为基础的地点周围，与成群的鱼儿一起水肺潜水。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b0f779e2b2568aea",
      "translationZh": "Street View：让你的世界以真实地点为基础",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "269ee6ec527152a3",
      "translationZh": "如今，在 Project Genie 中创建想象世界时，你也可以将真实地点作为基础。只需点按 Maps 图钉，选择美国境内的一个地点，还可以为你的世界选择一种风格，例如“Desert Sands”或“Stone Age”。然后，描述你的角色——比如你最喜欢的动物、漫画英雄，甚至是黏土动画怪兽——Genie 就会利用这些信息创建一个想象世界，其起始位置与 Street View 的真实世界影像相对应。这项能力由 Maps Imagery Grounding 提供支持，开发者也使用同一项技术，借助 Street View 创作令人惊叹的 AI 视觉内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d761815c8c497c2d",
      "translationZh": "想看看海底的金门大桥吗？选择“Ocean World”风格，即可在大桥周围与成群的鱼儿一起水肺潜水。或者，如果你想探索得克萨斯州标志性的沃思堡牲畜交易区在 1920 年代可能的模样，可以选择“B&W film”风格，看看一个有着酒馆、老式汽车和贸易站的世界。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1faed6f2c7269aaa",
      "translationZh": "Project Genie 现已提供美国境内地点的 Street View 影像，并计划逐步扩展到更多地点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4d1753b639341cb9",
      "translationZh": "Project Genie：现已向 Google AI Ultra 用户开放",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e31b02c2a78fd55",
      "translationZh": "从今天起，Project Genie（包括全新的 Street View 功能）将逐步向全球所有符合条件的 Google AI Ultra 200 订阅用户（18 岁及以上）开放。今天就试试用 Project Genie 进行创作吧。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bd0081209185e2da",
      "translationZh": "Project Genie 仍是 Google Labs 中的一个实验性研究原型，因此我们正在幕后持续努力，让细节更加清晰、更加准确。你可以在我们的网站上进一步了解我们的进展和目前的局限性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c97104d9f73758f7",
      "translationZh": "一起来看看我们在 Google I/O 2026 上发布的全部内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ba07e0e30582b629",
      "translationZh": "在收件箱中接收 Google 的最新消息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1c2f6429af68386",
      "translationZh": "完成了。只差最后一步。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "177af4ad1775d8ae",
      "translationZh": "请查看收件箱，确认你的订阅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ff091e7a47df15e",
      "translationZh": "你也可以使用一个……来订阅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fefef2f9c6cb957b",
      "translationZh": "我们在 2026 年 9 月发布的最新 AI 消息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0427f9d1d93e63e6",
      "translationZh": "我们正式推出 SynthID Bio，将我们的水印技术带入合成生物学领域。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5bfb7679daf70b90",
      "translationZh": "由行业创意人士打造的 6 款全新 Google Flow 工具",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "153e233d670c522c",
      "translationZh": "作者：Arathi Sethumadhavan 和 Olivia Sturman",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "36c7d9317dc998f7",
      "translationZh": "全新的 CC，一款专为家庭打造的 AI 智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "880e9cf783b136bb",
      "translationZh": "Dreambeans：每日故事，专为你酿就，现已向美国所有账号开放。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "62ce7c10cc4bc1b1",
      "translationZh": "逐帧重现一段跨越 70 年的爱情故事",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
